WEBVTT

00:02.480 --> 00:04.660
Doesn't look like it's stopping.

00:04.660 --> 00:06.850
Wanna take a walk to distract ourselves?

00:06.850 --> 00:08.410
In this rain?

00:08.410 --> 00:10.440
Romantically sharing 
an umbrella, of course.

00:11.110 --> 00:14.280
What are you talking about? 
On rainy days, you stay home and drink.

00:14.970 --> 00:18.910
Shoulders brushing under a single umbrella...
 Two people growing closer so naturally...

00:18.910 --> 00:22.870
Feeling tipsy, and with the sound of rain in
their ears, they gaze at each other...

00:24.630 --> 00:25.750
Escape.

00:28.430 --> 00:29.380
Disgusting!

00:29.380 --> 00:31.020
That's my line! Ew, ew, ew!

00:31.020 --> 00:32.630
No, it's <i>my</i> line!

00:32.630 --> 00:35.470
Honestly! Both of you need 
to just cut it out already!

