My Big Sister</b>

02:26.000 --> 02:28.910
<b>Episode 12</b>

02:26.000 --> 02:28.910
<b>Big
\h\hForever</b>

02:26.000 --> 02:28.910
<b>Sister</b>

02:29.010 --> 02:30.750
It finally cleared up!

02:31.290 --> 02:33.380
Yup. Perfect for hanging out the laundry.

02:33.380 --> 02:35.840
Today, I might even make it
 to a tavern to drink.

02:36.590 --> 02:38.210
It's flooded!

02:38.210 --> 02:39.990
Did the river overflow?

02:43.380 --> 02:44.390
Asahi!

02:48.320 --> 02:49.390
Th-This is...

02:49.390 --> 02:52.400
Big Sis Wind Cutter!

02:55.270 --> 02:56.390
Are you hurt, Asahi?

02:56.390 --> 02:57.480
No, I'm totally fine.

02:57.480 --> 02:58.940
Asahi, behind you!

03:00.090 --> 03:01.950
This is bad! I can't breathe!

03:02.290 --> 03:03.280
Asahi!

03:03.280 --> 03:05.490
It's my turn to save you this time!

03:05.490 --> 03:06.300
No, it's mine!

03:06.300 --> 03:08.860
Don't! You'll blow my head off!

03:09.840 --> 03:11.000
Escape!

03:13.240 --> 03:14.810
Asahi, are you all right?

03:14.810 --> 03:15.920
Yeah, somehow.

03:16.690 --> 03:18.760
But what exactly is this water?

03:18.760 --> 03:20.010
A slime.

03:20.010 --> 03:22.530
The whole town is covered in slimes.

03:24.600 --> 03:28.600
Everyone, get to higher ground! 
Escape to somewhere high up!

03:28.600 --> 03:34.100
Like the area where the nobles live!
 Everyone, evacuate there!

03:35.280 --> 03:38.410
Hey! No, don't!

03:38.410 --> 03:39.780
That voice. Tanya?

03:40.910 --> 03:43.420
Stop all that slippery wiggling!

03:43.420 --> 03:44.660
This is a sensitive issue.

03:45.770 --> 03:46.830
Are you okay, Tanya?

03:47.040 --> 03:49.700
Asahi-kun... Thank you!

03:49.700 --> 03:51.330
Stay back! You'll get it on me!

03:51.330 --> 03:54.250
That's so mean. Are you saying 
you hate things that are slippery and wet?

03:54.250 --> 03:55.860
No, he actually likes it.

03:55.860 --> 03:59.220
In our old world, he looked at lots
 of *BEEP* images of such scenes.

03:58.180 --> 04:00.500
Stop! Don't go revealing stuff like that!

04:00.500 --> 04:03.780
So how much does the Guild 
know about the current situation?

04:03.780 --> 04:07.860
Oh, right. This middle-class district that
we live in is the most water-damaged.

04:07.860 --> 04:10.180
It's more slime-damaged than water-damaged.

04:10.180 --> 04:14.690
I found something while reading some of the 
Kingdom of Ceasarion's oldest tomes earlier.

04:14.690 --> 04:16.940
Long ago, there was 
an incident like this one.

04:17.240 --> 04:19.280
It was called the Great Slime Flood.

04:19.280 --> 04:23.200
Apparently, there's this legendary slime 
that gets bigger by absorbing water.

04:23.200 --> 04:27.380
I see. So this slime has grown 
enormous due to all that rain.

04:27.380 --> 04:31.450
But it wouldn't budge an inch 
unless it was commanded to.

04:31.830 --> 04:33.830
Which means someone's behind this.

04:33.830 --> 04:37.970
Slime or mastermind, we just need to find 
them and choke the life out of them, right?

04:37.970 --> 04:41.800
Please leave something 
for me to hunt, sister.

04:42.520 --> 04:46.480
Well, for now, you should evacuate, 
Tanya. I'll save the townspeople.

04:46.480 --> 04:49.050
I-I can't be the only one who flees to safety.

04:49.050 --> 04:49.470
Huh?

04:49.700 --> 04:51.180
I mean, Roy's still...

04:51.180 --> 04:51.960
Roy?

04:52.570 --> 04:55.200
First thing this morning, 
he went out to play and...

04:57.270 --> 04:59.800
I promise I'll save Roy.

04:59.800 --> 05:00.900
Leave it to me.

05:00.900 --> 05:02.360
Asahi-kun.

05:03.490 --> 05:04.650
Please do that.

05:07.610 --> 05:09.220
Wait, you two!

05:09.220 --> 05:10.900
I think we need to split the load.

05:10.900 --> 05:12.390
I see. In that case...

05:12.390 --> 05:15.730
I'll use Big Sis Thunder to blow
 the slime away completely.

05:15.730 --> 05:18.620
Do you plan on electrocuting
the townspeople to death?!

05:18.620 --> 05:21.640
Then, I shall burn it to 
cinders with my flames!

05:21.640 --> 05:23.590
The town will become a sea of fire!

05:23.590 --> 05:27.400
You two are on standby. 
Just stay put until it all calms down.

05:27.400 --> 05:28.590
All right.

05:28.590 --> 05:29.970
Got it?

05:31.040 --> 05:32.770
That said...

05:32.770 --> 05:34.770
If a mastermind <i>is</i> behind this...

05:34.770 --> 05:37.600
We should go take care of it.

05:42.580 --> 05:45.680
Huon-san, you can do it! We're almost there!

05:45.680 --> 05:47.740
Yes. Thank you.

05:50.790 --> 05:51.490
H-Hey...

06:00.830 --> 06:02.230
You're...

06:05.800 --> 06:07.500
Scarlet flames, hear me.

06:07.500 --> 06:11.760
Become my fangs and burn 
my enemies to ash.

06:12.830 --> 06:15.720
Scarlet Fang!

06:26.870 --> 06:27.780
I shot it down.

06:27.780 --> 06:29.740
They really are amazing.

06:30.290 --> 06:31.700
Thank you so much...

06:32.170 --> 06:33.790
Clan Balmunc!

06:53.390 --> 06:56.850
Little monsters, you can do it. You can do it.

06:59.660 --> 07:02.580
I-It looks like the monsters went past us.

07:02.580 --> 07:03.860
That's a relief.

07:03.860 --> 07:06.950
I never imagined monsters 
would show up in this town.

07:06.950 --> 07:09.770
If we don't hurry and get somewhere safe...

07:10.420 --> 07:12.900
Miss! Don't push yourself too hard.

07:14.760 --> 07:16.760
<i>I have to do everything I can.</i>

07:18.750 --> 07:20.070
Roy!

07:20.630 --> 07:22.500
I'm so glad you're okay.

07:22.710 --> 07:24.080
Asahi-kun!

07:22.740 --> 07:24.080
Asahi-san!

07:24.410 --> 07:26.910
I see. You've been protecting her, huh?

07:27.520 --> 07:29.850
All right. I'll carry you on my back.

07:30.470 --> 07:31.860
Thank you!

07:31.860 --> 07:34.470
Roy, you lead the way 
until we reach higher ground.

07:34.470 --> 07:35.600
Me?

07:35.600 --> 07:37.350
I'm counting on you, buddy.

07:39.020 --> 07:39.850
Right.

07:43.060 --> 07:46.730
Asahi-kun! If we keep going this way, 
we should get to higher ground!

07:46.730 --> 07:47.930
All right.

07:51.500 --> 07:52.970
Let's hide somewhere!

07:52.970 --> 07:53.810
Right!

08:01.330 --> 08:03.730
<i>Crap. Nowhere to run. What do we do?</i>

08:14.760 --> 08:18.850
Wait, you're the guy who used to be 
Ogre Class. You came to help us?

08:20.920 --> 08:23.720
Don't wander around out here
 with an injured kid in tow.

08:23.720 --> 08:28.940
With all these slimes spawning, 
it's a great chance to earn some EXP.

08:28.940 --> 08:32.820
It's not like I came out here 
just to save you, you know.

08:29.580 --> 08:31.220
Behind us! Behind us!

08:37.770 --> 08:40.660
Astral Blade!

08:45.420 --> 08:47.030
Sieg-san!

08:47.340 --> 08:49.860
Wait, "Sieg"? You mean 
Dragon Hunter Siegfried?

08:49.860 --> 08:51.000
Yeah.

08:51.210 --> 08:54.010
Wow! I guess even as a down-and-outer,
 you're still Dragon Class!

08:54.010 --> 08:56.010
Could you <i>not</i> call me a down-and-outer?

08:56.540 --> 08:59.710
Did you cut off the source of the 
Great Slime Flood with that attack?

08:59.710 --> 09:01.890
No, with a giant slime like this...

09:03.810 --> 09:06.650
Unless you take out the core, 
it'll just keep regenerating.

09:06.990 --> 09:08.270
But that's...

09:09.360 --> 09:12.220
They're treating the wounded 
up at the cathedral.

09:12.220 --> 09:16.580
Asahi-kun, after you've gotten the kids to 
safety there, go look for the slime's core.

09:16.580 --> 09:17.420
Sieg-san!

09:17.420 --> 09:18.780
Leave this area to me.

09:19.840 --> 09:20.870
Yes, sir.

09:26.460 --> 09:28.810
It's been a while since I did any real work.

09:29.160 --> 09:31.960
You're gonna fight this thing with me, right?

09:32.340 --> 09:34.920
You'd better not slow me down, Dragon Hunter.

09:35.690 --> 09:37.340
Sounds promising.

09:37.340 --> 09:40.200
Well, with that...

09:40.200 --> 09:43.480
I, Siegfried, will head into battle.

09:43.920 --> 09:46.410
Please open the gate! Let us in!

09:46.410 --> 09:48.770
Please! We have wounded out here!

09:49.130 --> 09:51.120
Please! Open the gate!

09:53.590 --> 09:55.190
Open up!

09:55.540 --> 09:58.860
Those lowlifes. They've locked 
themselves in to stay out of it.

09:58.860 --> 10:01.160
They may stand by as 
the townsfolk are killed.

10:01.160 --> 10:02.530
But that's...

10:03.050 --> 10:04.770
Roy. Asahi-kun.

10:07.070 --> 10:10.650
Slime core. Cathedral.
 Slime core. Cathedral.

10:09.730 --> 10:11.020
Asahi-kun!

10:12.280 --> 10:13.690
There! Look!

10:14.610 --> 10:16.190
The cathedral!

