10:18.010 --> 10:21.010
<b>Starting Life
 in Another 
World With 
My Big Sister</b>

10:23.260 --> 10:27.080
If it's the Brigandine family...
If we go to Gloria-san's house, then maybe...

10:28.800 --> 10:31.310
The slime's made it all the way up here?

10:31.550 --> 10:35.280
The water level just keeps rising. 
We have to hurry and do something!

10:35.280 --> 10:36.380
Yes, ma'am!

10:39.610 --> 10:41.820
Good work getting us here, Roy.

10:41.820 --> 10:42.970
Asahi-kun.

10:42.970 --> 10:46.130
Thank you, Asahi-san. I'll be all right now.

10:47.290 --> 10:48.460
Does it hurt?

10:48.460 --> 10:49.750
I-I'm fine.

10:50.010 --> 10:52.300
Wait here. I'll go find someone to treat—

10:52.300 --> 10:53.110
Heal!

10:54.390 --> 10:55.410
Heal!

10:56.000 --> 10:57.320
Heal!

10:59.990 --> 11:01.890
Hey, you're being way too reckless.

11:02.110 --> 11:04.000
You're gonna end up collapsing, too.

11:05.560 --> 11:06.640
Heal!

11:08.630 --> 11:10.820
Is there anyone I haven't cast Heal on yet?

11:10.820 --> 11:11.930
Sophie!

11:12.760 --> 11:14.770
Exalted Hero! Are you uninjured?

11:17.940 --> 11:19.820
What about you, Sophie? Are you all right?

11:25.640 --> 11:26.950
Recovery complete!

11:26.950 --> 11:28.290
R-Right!

11:28.540 --> 11:29.530
Heal!

11:30.950 --> 11:32.840
You'll be all right now.

11:32.840 --> 11:33.960
Thank you!

11:33.960 --> 11:36.590
It hurts! My leg hurts!

11:36.590 --> 11:38.300
Just hang on a sec! <i>Please</i>!

11:36.930 --> 11:38.300
Huh? Those guys are...

11:38.530 --> 11:40.840
Quit your wailin'. 
We're gettin' out of here now!

11:40.840 --> 11:42.950
We can't stay in this town any longer.

11:42.950 --> 11:44.970
They're from the Pitch-Black Brigade.

11:45.760 --> 11:48.580
I can't run! Please don't leave me behind!

11:48.580 --> 11:49.360
Heal!

11:50.090 --> 11:51.960
Wait... Sophie?

11:51.960 --> 11:53.480
You'll be all right now.

11:53.700 --> 11:56.800
Wh-What did you just do, you rat? 
You tryin' to make us owe you a—

11:56.800 --> 11:57.610
Be quiet.

11:59.820 --> 12:03.500
If adventurers weep and wail, 
it gets the townsfolk even more scared!

12:03.500 --> 12:05.410
Don't you understand something so <i>basic</i>?

12:05.790 --> 12:09.170
Cannon fodder should act like it
 and put on a brave face!

12:12.570 --> 12:13.880
You've been a big help, Sophie.

12:13.880 --> 12:15.540
It's a healer's duty, after all.

12:15.540 --> 12:20.250
I'm gonna go look for the slime's core. 
Can I ask you to look after the children?

12:20.250 --> 12:21.610
Yes, of course!

12:21.610 --> 12:25.550
Monsters may eventually come here,
 too. I have to find it quickly.

12:25.550 --> 12:26.800
H-Hey!

12:27.110 --> 12:29.140
We aren't cannon fodder!

12:29.140 --> 12:33.030
And we have enough experience to be able
 to protect the people here, y'know.

12:34.060 --> 12:37.230
If monsters do show up here, we'll prove it.

12:37.490 --> 12:41.000
Then, please act as a wall 
of flesh and protect everyone.

12:41.000 --> 12:42.740
Phrasing!

12:44.060 --> 12:46.110
Even Gloria-san's house is...

12:56.270 --> 12:57.880
From above and below.

12:57.880 --> 12:59.210
And from the front, too?

13:01.170 --> 13:02.960
Now, get swallowed up.

13:02.960 --> 13:06.400
Drown in your despair, humans!

13:06.400 --> 13:09.040
They say when you drink, 
don't drown yourself in it.

13:09.040 --> 13:11.890
So you're the mastermind 
behind things this time, hm?

13:11.890 --> 13:15.560
Sending the slime to invade while
opening doors to another dimension,

13:15.560 --> 13:18.630
then summoning minor monsters 
and using them to attack.

13:18.780 --> 13:21.580
This is the perfect place to
 see the whole board, isn't it?

13:21.920 --> 13:25.180
Witch of Control, Guriligula.

13:27.420 --> 13:28.280
Kuon.

13:29.180 --> 13:31.160
What does "noblesse oblige" entail?

13:31.380 --> 13:37.040
It is the duty of the nobility to protect 
the commoners when their lives are at risk.

13:37.040 --> 13:39.070
And when you say "nobility"...

13:39.070 --> 13:41.200
You, mistress.

13:41.200 --> 13:44.010
Then, it is time for me to make my move.

13:45.130 --> 13:47.470
Sebastian, stand aside.

13:48.170 --> 13:51.850
We will open the main gate and 
welcome those who seek shelter.

13:51.850 --> 13:57.850
If we do that, the chaos out there
 may well end up inside the mansion.

13:58.150 --> 14:00.610
Even if it does, 
I will not retreat a single step.

14:00.610 --> 14:04.820
Those with courage and 
conviction are the true nobles.

14:05.120 --> 14:08.730
Mistress, are you saying you will 
take full responsibility for this?

14:09.340 --> 14:11.110
Do you think I cannot?

14:14.170 --> 14:16.370
You have grown so much.

14:21.630 --> 14:25.550
We've taken care of most of them for now.

14:25.870 --> 14:27.720
But if any more show...

14:33.890 --> 14:35.090
Gloria-san!

14:35.090 --> 14:36.310
Tanya!

14:36.310 --> 14:39.480
Well done on making it all the way here.

14:41.610 --> 14:45.750
Asahi-kun went to look for my little
 brother, Roy. He headed into the town.

14:46.580 --> 14:49.870
Okay, you can leave the rest to us. 
Hurry inside the mansion.

14:49.870 --> 14:50.740
Please help them.

14:52.700 --> 14:54.280
Tanya-chan, look out!

14:56.490 --> 14:58.920
Tiger Crash!

15:00.330 --> 15:01.940
Ow.

15:02.730 --> 15:06.800
Tigga Hildebrandt, age 42, has arrived.

15:06.800 --> 15:11.040
A tiger shows no mercy to those
who attack its pride.

15:11.040 --> 15:13.480
He seems suspicious, 
but shall we leave it to him?

15:13.480 --> 15:16.120
Yes. He <i>is</i> suspicious, 
but it will probably be fine.

15:16.120 --> 15:20.620
I'm <i>not</i> suspicious! I'm Tigga Hildebrandt,
 age 42! Just ask your butler!

15:20.620 --> 15:24.480
Why would Kilmaria of Corruption 
be in a place like this?

15:24.480 --> 15:28.800
How dare you force my 
regular pub to temporarily close.

15:28.800 --> 15:32.990
How dare you cause so many problems 
for Asahi. Certain death awaits you.

15:33.930 --> 15:35.910
Kilmaria-sama.

15:35.910 --> 15:39.870
Is this you betraying the Demon King?

15:39.870 --> 15:44.380
Don't do that. Come and enjoy 
the chaos with me instead. Okay?

15:44.690 --> 15:45.630
We refuse.

15:46.030 --> 15:49.010
Why are <i>you</i> the one answering?

15:49.010 --> 15:52.860
You useless, foolish lump!

15:54.680 --> 15:57.480
Scorch and die!

15:57.850 --> 16:00.640
Slime core. Slime core.

16:00.640 --> 16:02.540
Searching randomly won't work.

16:02.540 --> 16:04.220
At a time like this, I should...

16:04.220 --> 16:05.810
Asahi!

16:06.060 --> 16:08.480
Now that I'm here, 
there's no need for you to fret!

16:08.480 --> 16:10.670
Th-That was quite a flashy entrance, Gloria.

16:10.670 --> 16:12.280
W-W-Was it?

16:12.280 --> 16:15.490
But you got here at the perfect time.
 I need to ask you something.

16:17.190 --> 16:19.560
Kuon's agile and has a keen eye.

16:19.560 --> 16:23.080
I hoped she could go along the rooftops 
and look for the core from up high.

16:23.370 --> 16:25.200
<i>Skill: Hawk Eye.</i>

16:31.290 --> 16:33.840
<i>There's an intense energy 
coming from that watchtower.</i>

16:34.150 --> 16:37.350
<i>That is... Miss Maya, and probably Miss Maria.</i>

16:39.230 --> 16:41.870
<i>I have to concentrate on my own mission.</i>

16:44.250 --> 16:45.270
<i>Found it.</i>

16:45.580 --> 16:47.690
Wh-What's this?

16:47.690 --> 16:49.940
Why didn't you take any damage?

16:49.940 --> 16:53.070
That heat felt about the 
same as a sauna. It was nice.

16:53.070 --> 16:54.550
A sauna? Huh? What?

16:54.550 --> 16:59.830
This is a perfect opportunity. Allow me 
to give you a lecture on how to use flames.

16:59.830 --> 17:01.370
No thanks, I'm—

17:12.510 --> 17:16.970
Oh? You withstood Kilmaria's
 attack. Impressively done.

17:17.260 --> 17:19.860
Then, as a special treat, 
I'll use my secret weapon.

17:19.860 --> 17:22.970
I'll break out a new technique 
that's still under development.

17:23.770 --> 17:26.640
Big Sis Forever.

17:28.440 --> 17:31.310
Wh-What is this insanely 
dangerous-looking light?

17:31.310 --> 17:32.350
Retreat!

17:36.200 --> 17:37.530
Ah...

17:37.530 --> 17:40.700
It feels kinda warm.

17:43.880 --> 17:45.320
Kuon!

17:45.320 --> 17:47.170
Is that the core?

17:47.400 --> 17:50.840
My apologies. Its movements 
make it slightly difficult to capture.

17:50.840 --> 17:52.800
In that case, we'll do it together.

17:52.800 --> 17:56.420
On my mark, we'll attack it from three sides.

17:56.980 --> 17:58.130
Wh-What's going on?

17:58.760 --> 18:00.000
It shot upward?

18:00.000 --> 18:02.390
At that height, even I cannot...

18:04.120 --> 18:06.920
Gloria! Can you hurl me up there?

18:07.760 --> 18:09.730
Gloria, you're the only one I can ask!

18:09.730 --> 18:11.870
I'm the only one...

18:14.310 --> 18:17.510
To that, I say, "Yes!"

18:18.320 --> 18:21.070
Reach it!

18:26.920 --> 18:28.410
<i>I-It's so high up.</i>

18:28.750 --> 18:31.420
<i>I can't fix my aim.</i>

18:31.420 --> 18:32.580
Asahi!

18:33.630 --> 18:36.290
The water level's dropping?

18:39.430 --> 18:40.590
If this is how it is...

18:43.720 --> 18:46.600
Go!

18:45.060 --> 18:47.350
<b>Owned Skill: Stone-Throwing Lv: 2</b>

18:48.360 --> 18:50.400
That's perfect, Exalted Hero!

18:50.400 --> 18:51.910
Asahi-kun...

18:51.910 --> 18:52.730
It'll make it!

18:54.520 --> 18:55.940
The core moved.

18:55.940 --> 18:57.490
Asahi!

18:57.490 --> 19:00.740
No. Hit the target!

19:17.170 --> 19:19.050
A Level 2 curveball.

19:19.050 --> 19:19.840
Wait...

19:30.090 --> 19:32.310
Well done, Asahi.

19:32.720 --> 19:34.010
Maya-nee.

19:35.310 --> 19:36.180
Yeah.

19:37.070 --> 19:39.980
When we get home, 
it's head-patting time as your reward.

19:39.980 --> 19:42.230
I'll pat your head, too.

19:42.230 --> 19:44.200
Um, no thanks.

19:46.340 --> 19:49.040
I'm so glad everyone's safe.

19:49.700 --> 19:55.590
Now that I think about it, at the end there, 
why'd the slime's water level sink like that?

19:56.000 --> 19:59.010
No idea. Why <i>did</i> that happen?

20:00.610 --> 20:02.520
It really is a mystery, isn't it?

21:33.440 --> 21:37.020
<i>Thanks to my contributions in 
bringing the Great Slime Flood to an end,</i>

21:37.020 --> 21:40.020
<i>I was joyfully promoted to Golem Class.</i>

21:40.020 --> 21:47.030
<i>My clan and the folk from the guild came to 
celebrate the happy outcome with me, but...</i>

21:48.040 --> 21:49.280
Siegfried!

21:49.280 --> 21:51.780
This is such a happy occasion.

21:52.030 --> 21:54.820
This is supposed to be in my honor, but...

21:54.820 --> 21:56.980
Would you like me to converse with you?

21:56.980 --> 21:58.710
It's okay. Don't mind me.

21:58.710 --> 22:00.290
Asahi-kun!

22:00.290 --> 22:04.840
Um, as a reward for saving Roy, 
and for helping to calm the chaos...

22:04.840 --> 22:07.930
You will receive a 
passionate kiss from a maiden!

22:07.930 --> 22:10.570
Which one of us will you pick?

22:10.570 --> 22:13.180
What?! What are you talking about?!

22:13.180 --> 22:14.890
We should really do this fairly.

22:14.890 --> 22:15.970
Rock, paper, scissors?

22:15.970 --> 22:17.440
I could ask for nothing better!

22:17.440 --> 22:20.190
Rock, paper, scissors! 
And again! And again!

22:20.190 --> 22:23.950
Mistress, if Asahi were your live-in worker, 
you could kiss him whenever you liked.

22:23.950 --> 22:24.820
That's true!

22:24.820 --> 22:26.570
I'm not doing that!

22:27.160 --> 22:28.920
Honestly...

22:31.300 --> 22:34.690
Huh? What's wrong, Maya-nee? 
Why are you out here?

22:34.690 --> 22:37.100
Because you're the star today, Asahi.

22:37.590 --> 22:40.990
I'm trying to erase my presence as 
much as possible by staying out here.

22:41.840 --> 22:43.380
What are you talking about?

22:44.270 --> 22:47.580
You've grown quite a lot 
since we first came here, Asahi.

22:48.440 --> 22:50.060
It's thanks to the people inside.

22:50.910 --> 22:55.350
Because they were all there for us, we made 
it through all kinds of tough situations.

22:56.570 --> 22:59.370
That goes for you, too, Maya-nee. Thank you.

23:01.610 --> 23:05.050
Thank you for being my big sister.

23:12.890 --> 23:14.190
What are you doing?

23:14.190 --> 23:18.310
However you look at it, this is the perfect 
mood for a boy and girl to kiss, isn't it?

23:18.310 --> 23:21.110
Maya-nee, you haven't 
grown at all, have you?

23:21.110 --> 23:24.560
Exalted Hero, Gloria-san is crying.

23:24.560 --> 23:25.290
What?

23:25.290 --> 23:28.270
Honestly. It's because you 
said you wouldn't kiss her.

23:25.290 --> 23:28.270
There, there. There, there.

23:28.270 --> 23:29.780
What am I meant to do about that?

23:29.780 --> 23:30.990
Asahi, you're in the wrong.

23:30.990 --> 23:31.820
Why?

23:31.820 --> 23:34.780
If we're talking about kisses, 
I can give you as many as you want.

23:34.780 --> 23:38.490
Ah, you're just complicating
 things! Don't butt in!

23:39.560 --> 23:43.020
<i>Our life in another world continues.</i>

23:43.380 --> 23:46.530
<i>And that's how it is for now.</i>
